    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bharaiseemia kuiihi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhonsui bha Isiraeri, kurua Tani kuhika Bheeri-sebha, hamui na abhantö bhë ënsë ya Gireati, umuiraniö umugima, mbaairaini Misibha haara, mbere yö ÖMÖNENE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhatangati bhonsui bhi ibhiaro bhia Isiraeri bhakarichoka mbere yu umuiranio göa abhantö bhë Ënooköë. Bhonsui igo mbaarëngë abhasirikare bha amagörö bha guitanëra ibhiögë ibhirara bhinai (400,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, bhakanyoora amang'ana iga abhantö bhandë bhaara bha Isiraeri mbaanyoorrë bhakömaini Misibha haara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö Abhaisiraeri bhakabhuuria ömösaacha Ömörawi öra iga, “Tatöteebhia, ubhunyanku bhöyö niyekë bhookorekani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ömörawi ööra, ömösaacha wu umuikarani ööra, akabhahunchukiria iga, “Uni na umuikarani waane ntoohikërë kumugi go Gibhea, umugi guikiaro ke Bhenchamini korri töraare ho ubhutikö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si abhantö bhu umugi go Gibhea bhagaacha ubhutikö bhakanaaria inyumba ëno waanyoorrë ndaayë. Mbaatunërë kunyita, bhakagaka umuikarani waane kuhika agakua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uni nkaimukia ikihundugu keee, nkamökengakenga amang'engang'enga na kögahira kubhiaro bhionsui bhia Isiraeri, kugira bhaakorrë ëng'ana ya kuriirria na ëhotoku harë Isiraeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono bhainyu bharë Bhaisiraeri, mötahunchukirania na kuruusia ëngamba yeinyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhonsui hamui igo, bhakaimëërra na kögamba iga, “Taaho örë wonsui gatai yeitö öno araaringe guitume reee gösë ka waae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo nkeeho töraakore igörö ya Gibhea: Ntöraakore ëgëkoobhoe keebhörë törabhaitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntöraahöre abhantö ikumi harë këra abhantö irigana rimui kubhiaro bhionsui bhia Isiraeri, na abhantö irigana rimui harë këra abhantö ëgëköë kimui, na abhantö ëgëköë kimui harë këra abhantö ibhiköë ikumi. Bhayö mbaraabhe na ëmërëmo ge körentera bharikia bhaabho ibhiakörea bhano bharaabhe na ëmërëmo ge köbhörööta umugi go Gibhea gönsë ya Bhenchamini köbhösaria bhoobho na öbhöhotoku bhöno bhaakora harë Isiraeri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö abhasaacha bhonsui bha Isiraeri mbaikömerë kömooyo gumui guisiira umugi go Gibhea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhi ibhiaro bhia Isiraeri bhagatöma abhahira mang'ana kuhika ëntahana yi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, bharagamba iga, “Kana, mbunyanku kë bhöno bhoorichokera gatai yeinyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono mötatöha abhantö abharërëëma bhayö bha Gireati korri töbhaite na gusikia ubhunyanku bhöno kurua harë Isiraeri.” Si abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini tëbhaiguërëëyë bhamura omoobho, Abhaisiraeri hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö bhagaiköma Gibhea haara kurua këra mugi goobho, korri bhaitane na Abhaisiraeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini bhagaköma gukurua kumigi geebho iricheesi ria abhantö ibhiköë mërongo ëbhërë na bhasansabha (26,000) bhano bha guitanëra ibhiögë, abhamenyi bhu umugi go Gibhea nabho bhagaköma abhantö amagana muhungatë (700) bhano bhaahööyöë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gatai ya abhantö bhayö bhaahööyöë mbaarëngë mo abhantö amagana muhungatë bhano bhaarë këmosi; këra umui naatörrë körekera irigëna kundrruuchi na körasa urutuukia atamochiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri, gutiga abhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, mbaakömërë abhantö ibhiaro bhinai (400,000) bhano bhagötöra guitanëra ibhiögë. Bhonsui mbaarëngë abhakarë bhi iriihi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iriihi guisiira Abhabhenchamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhakaya Bheteri gutuna öbhöragirria kö Ënooköë, bhatöre kömanya ikiaro këno këratange guitana na abhantö bhë ëhamatë ya Bhenchamini. ÖMÖNENE agatara ikiaro ye Yuta gëtange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, Abhaisiraeri bhakaya inkio, bhagatööra irisanchö reebho hang'i na umugi go Gibhea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhakarichoka guitana na abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini hang'i na Gibhea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini bhakarichoka këbhara yu umugi go Gibhea bhagaitana na Abhaisiraeri, urusikö röyö bhagaita Abhaisiraeri ibhiköë mërongo ëbherë na bhabhërë (22,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si Abhaisiraeri bhagaitirimikia, bhagaiseemia guiki kuiihi ahasë haara bhaiseemiyi ëre mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, Abhaisiraeri bhakaya igörö, bhagaköörra ÖMÖNENE, kuhika ömögoroobha. Hakurua bhagasabha öbhöragirria gukurua kö ÖMÖNENE iga: “Niyeke, niiga tuyi guiki guitana na bhamura omueitö, bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini?” ÖMÖNENE akabhahunchukiria iga, “Mötaya muitane nabho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö urusikö ro kabhërë Abhaisiraeri bhakahika hang'i guitana na abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urusikö röyö ro kabhërë abhantö bhi ikiaro ke mbaaruurë Gibhea na guitania Abhaisiraeri, bhagaita gunchonge Abhaisiraeri ibhiköë ikumi na bhinaanai (18,000), bhonsui bhano bha guitanëra ibhiögë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhonsui bhi iricheesi ria Abhaisiraeri bhakaya Bheteri. Mbaikaayë ho mbere yö ÖMÖNENE bharang'uunya na guisasa kuhika ömögoroobha. Bhakaruusiria ÖMÖNENE ibhimuenso bhia gösambërëërröa na ikimuenso kiö ömörembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhagasabha ÖMÖNENE abhahe öbhöragiirria. Ënkaaga ëyö Irisandëko ri Imuuma yë Ënooköë ndeerëngë Bheteri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhinehasi ömoona wa Ereasari, ömoona o Haruni naarëngë na ëmërëmo ge kuirigania mbere yaae. Abhaisiraeri bhakabhuuria ÖMÖNENE iga, “Gösë, niiga tuyi guiki guitana na bhamura omueitö, abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini?” ÖMÖNENE akabhateebhia iga, “Mötaya. Icho nëndache mbatööre kömabhoko gainyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, Abhaisiraeri bhagatööra abhantö bhuiguunyo kunaaria umugi go Gibhea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhakaya guitana na abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini kurusikö ro gatatö. Bhagaiseemi guisiira umugi go Gibhea kehaara bhaakorrë ëkëmbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua hano abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini bhaaruurë kumugi götanga guitana na Abhaisiraeri, mbaarentëröë këbhara yu umugi. Nkebhaayë guiki kehaara bhaakorrë ëkëmbere hayö, bhagaita abhamui bha abhantö bha Isiraeri guchinchëra ichinene cha kögëëra kumugi go Bheteri na Gibhea, kuhika masisi. Mbaaitërë Abhaisiraeri bhano bhakaabha mërongo ëtatö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bha Bhenchamini bhagaitegeerra iga, “Töbhatemërë gi ichinkaaga chino chaaheta.” Si Abhaisiraeri bhakagamba iga, “Bhaitö töng'ose korri töbharute harai na umugi gönchëra ënene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö abhantö bhonsui bha Isiraeri bhakarua ahasë haabho na guiseemia guiki Bhaari-tamari haara. Bharikia bhaabho bhano wanyoorrë bhagunyërë bhakarichoka bhöngöbhöngö kurua ahasë haabho ëntahana ya nyancha yu umugi go Gibhea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhasirikare abhakarë bhano bhaahöyöë gukurua kubhiaro bhionsui bhia Isiraeri bhakahika mbere yu umugi go Gibhea. Iriihi riu urusikö röyö ndebhaayë irrrörö bhökong'u. Si abhantö bha Bhenchamini tëbhaamanyërë iga ugusika koobho nhang'i koorë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ÖMÖNENE naakërrë abhantö bha Bhenchamini mbere ya Abhaisiraeri. Abhaisiraeri bhagaita abhantö bha Bhenchamini ibhiköë mërongo ëbhërë na bhitaano na irigana rimui (25,100) bhano bha guitanëra ibhiögë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini bhakamaaha iga bhaakërröë.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keebhörë Abhaisiraeri bhaakërrë",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhakaringa nnyuma nkanya nköng'osa bharë abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, kugira mbaaiteng'eyë bharikia bhaabho bhano wanyoorrë bhatöörröë kögönyëra umugi go Gibhea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhaara bhaatöörröë guchobhera umugi bhakarichoka bhöngöbhöngö na guitania umugi go Gibhea na guitëra bhonsui bhano bhaarëngë mo gunchonge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkanyoora bhaitabhërraini na abhantö abhandë bhaara bha Isiraeri igörö yë ëkëmanyiirrio kimui. Mbaaitabhërraini iga bhaara wanyoorrë bhaarachobhera hano bharaache bhamaahe irioki iririto rërachönga igörö kurua kumugi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bhoono, bhaitani umugi. Ënkaaga ëyö, abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini mbaanyoorrë bhaisërë guita abhantö bhano bhakaabha mërongo ëtatö bha Isiraeri na göteebhania iga, “Töbhatemërë gë këmbere hayö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si ëkëmanyiirriö këëra kiömönara gui irioki hano geetangërë kurichokera kumugi, abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini hano bhaamagiri nyuma yaabho, bhakarögööra kömaaha iga umugi goobho nkuibhancha görë ömörro irioki riratiira kuya kuriöbha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nëho Abhaisiraeri bhaaihönchööyë, na abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini bhakagootöa na irihahia kugira mbaarööchë iga ugusika koobho nkonyoorrë kuhikërë hang'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö, bhakaihönchöra, bhakang'osa Abhaisiraeri kuya kuibhara, si iriihi rëkabhahëkëëra; bhaguitakia nkanyoora ngataigatai ya amacheesi abhërë ga Abhaisiraeri bharëngë, na abhasirikare bhano bhaarichokërë bhakabhasikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri mbaanaarri abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, bhakabharondia gukurua Noha kuhika rögörö yu umugi go Gibhea bharaita abhaaru bhaabho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urusikö röyö abhantö ibhiköë ikumi na bhinaanai (18,000) bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, bhonsui abhasirikare abhakarë, mbaaitëröë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhandë bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini mbaaihönchöyë, bhakang'osa kuya guiköngö kuhika körötare ro Rimoni. Abhandë ibhiköë bhitaano (5,000) mbaaitëröë gönchëra ënene hano bhaarë köng'osa. Abhaisiraeri mbaagenderreyi köbharondia bhörrö abhantö bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini kuhika kumugi go Gitomu, bhagaita abhantö ibhiköë bhibhërë (2,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhonsui bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini bhano bhaaitëröë urusikö röyö mbaarëngë ibhiköë mërongo ëbhërë na bhitaano (25,000), bhano bha guitanëra ibhiögë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si abhasaacha amagana asansabha (600) bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini mbaatörrë köng'osera guiköngö kuhika körötare ro Rimoni, bhakamenya ho gönkaaga yi imieri ënai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhakaihönchörra abhantö bhandë bhi ikiaro ke Bhenchamini, bhakabhaita gunchonge bhonsui: Abhasaacha, abhagaikörö, abhaana na ichitiinyi. Na imigi gionsui gëno bhaanyoorrë haara bhakagësambërëërra na ömörro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
